  "prediction": "The report provides a comprehensive list of resources for understanding the legislative process and related procedures in the United States Congress. The resources include both print and digital materials produced by various government agencies, such as the Government Publishing Office (GPO) and the Parliamentarians of the House and Senate. These resources cover a wide range of topics, from introductory overviews of the legislative process to detailed guides on specific procedures and glossaries of related terms. Some resources are available to the public, while others are only accessible to congressional offices. The report also mentions several CRS reports and videos that are freely available to the public on the CRS website and Congress.gov, respectively. Overall, this report serves as a valuable starting point for anyone looking to gain a deeper understanding of the legislative process and the resources available to support that learning.",
  "scored_prediction": "The report provides a comprehensive list of resources for understanding the legislative process and related procedures in the United States Congress. The resources include both print and digital materials produced by various government agencies, such as the Government Publishing Office (GPO) and the Parliamentarians of the House and Senate. These resources cover a wide range of topics, from introductory overviews of the legislative process to detailed guides on specific procedures and glossaries of related terms. Some resources are available to the public, while others are only accessible to congressional offices. The report also mentions several CRS reports and videos that are freely available to the public on the CRS website and Congress.gov, respectively. Overall, this report serves as a valuable starting point for anyone looking to gain a deeper understanding of the legislative process and the resources available to support that learning.",
  "score": 28.787878343434347,
  "answers": [
    "Written for congressional staff, this report identifies and provides details on how to obtain information on legislative procedures and process in the House and Senate. It provides references to selected CRS products and offers information on the CRS legislative institutes. A listing of selected supplementary materials is also provided. This report will be updated as new information is available."
